Third-party components
----------------------

This Lens integrates packages and platform APIs from the Lens Studio Asset
Library and Snap Spectacles ecosystem, including but not limited to:

  - Remote Service Gateway (RSG)
  - Spectacles Interaction Kit (SIK)
  - Spectacles UI Kit
  - Spectacles Sync Kit
  - Spatial Image

Those components remain subject to their own licenses and terms from Snap Inc.
and other licensors. They are not relicensed under Apache-2.0 by this
repository alone.

Prior public iterations of this work were published as decor-assistant-spectacles
and Enhanced_AI_Decor_Assistant by the same author.
